# FailureReasonCountIsBreakdown: the failure-reason count sizes the breakdown.
MODULE: SchemaComplianceScan
ROW: FailureReasonCountIsBreakdown
FILE: src/lattice.schema/SchemaComplianceScanResults.cs
DETECTORS: SchemaComplianceScanResultsTests.A_report_round_trips_through_the_result_map
SUMMARY: the failure-reason count is written as the policy's rule count

--- FIND
            [FailureReasonCountKey] = breakdown.Count.ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture),
--- REPLACE
